OL,3,GNEWSADad's death inspires hospital room
OL,4,Amakeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FA health care assistant has
OL,7,Fhand-painted a feature wall in a
OL,8,Fhospital quiet room to make it more
OL,9,Fwelcoming for families who could be
OL,10,Freceiving distressing news.
OL,12,FFrea Brown has spent the past few
OL,13,Fmonths painting a rainforest-themed
OL,14,Fmural at the Woodview mental health
OL,15,Ffacility in Whalley, Lancashire, where
OL,16,Fshe works.
OL,18,FHer mum, Angela Brown, said Frea was
OL,19,Finspired after being told her dad was
OL,20,Fgoing to die in "the most awful room,
OL,21,Ffull of old bits of furniture and the
OL,22,Fwalls were grim".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
