OL,3,GNEWSADad's death inspires hospital room
OL,4,Amakeover
OL,5,
OL,6,F"People being in hospital is awful. The
OL,7,Flast thing you want to be looking at is
OL,8,Fhorrible walls and surroundings,"
OL,9,FAngela said, adding it would have made
OL,10,F"a massive difference" if the room was
OL,11,Fmore welcoming.
